{"Say":{"0":{"0":"Meow. You must find it strange to see a cat talk like this, yes? Well, my name is #b#p1040002##k. Pets usually don't talk unless they become very closely attached to their owners, but my master is a fairy living in this forest. ","1":"The fairy gave me a little bit of magical abilities, which enabled me to talk to others on my own, and also become transparent at will! Since you came a long way to see me, can you help me find the stuff that I lost?","yes":{"0":"What I lost is my #b#t4031273##k. My master gave me that as a present, and it's a very important item to me as a result. I really love playing around with that furball, but then, a few days ago, I dropped it somewhere, and the furball kept rolling around the forest. Now I can't find it... ","1":"I have a feeling the #r#o0210100#s#k, a very curious bunch, took it in amusement, and they're not returning it! Please find the meowy #b#t4031273##k from #r#o0210100#s#k. Find the furball, and bring it with #byour pet#k, and then I'll reward you with something nice."},"no":{"0":"Are you here just to see me out of a curiosity? You must have nothing to do. If you don't have anything to do, then just leave. Meow!"}},"1":{"0":"Meow! That was incredible! It's the red furball that I lost, indeed! Thank you so much! Meow!","yes":{"0":"Don't you feel like you've gotten really close with your pet? I told your pet that you've been very good to me. Then your pet told me it's very happy to have a good master like you, and thinks you're the best!"},"stop":{"0":{},"item":{"0":"The item I lost is a #bsmall, red furball #k."}}}},"Check":{"0":{"npc":1040002,"quest":{"0":{"id":2103,"state":2,"order":1}},"pet":{"0":{"id":5000000},"1":{"id":5000001},"2":{"id":5000002},"3":{"id":5000003},"4":{"id":5000004},"5":{"id":5000005},"6":{"id":5000006},"7":{"id":5000007},"8":{"id":5000008},"9":{"id":5000009},"10":{"id":5000010},"11":{"id":5000011},"12":{"id":5000012},"13":{"id":5000013},"14":{"id":5000014},"15":{"id":5000015},"16"